WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.396
A triple is not your max.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:08.684
For a heavy set of two to five reps, pick the lift. Then pick the weight. Log it with its reps.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:16.749
It is saved as a three rep max. Your one rep max does not change. Your percentages stay true in every program.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.240
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
